<title>SOUTH AFRICA: S.African Jan trade surplus 517.20 million rand.</title>
<headline>S.African Jan trade surplus 517.20 million rand.</headline>
<dateline>PRETORIA 1997-02-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>South Africa recorded a trade surplus of 517.20 million rand in January from a 2.04 billion rand surplus in December, latest South African Revenue Service figures show.</p>
</text>
